   "duration_sec": 7.47
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C15-D002",
   "turn_index": 1,
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "source_text": "リンさん、先生に転送してもいいですか。買い物の文章も練習に使いたいです。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C15-D002-S01",
    "C15-D002-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-commercial-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 7.82,
   "end_sec": 13.083,
   "duration_sec": 5.263
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C15-D003",
   "turn_index": 2,
   "speaker": "林梅",
   "source_text": "ええ、いいですよ。アドレスは他の人に教えてはいけませんね。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C15-D003-S01",
    "C15-D003-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 13.433,
   "end_sec": 17.629,
   "duration_sec": 4.196
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C15-D004",
   "turn_index": 3,
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "source_text": "分かりました。今日は普通体で練習したいです。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C15-D004-S01",
    "C15-D004-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-commercial-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 17.979,
   "end_sec": 20.884,
   "duration_sec": 2.905
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C15-D005",
   "turn_index": 4,
   "speaker": "林梅",
   "source_text": "私もです。昨日はセンターにいました。机に本がありました。でも、電話はありませんでした。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C15-D005-S01",
    "C15-D005-S02",
    "C15-D005-S03",
    "C15-D005-S04"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 21.234,
   "end_sec": 28.155,
   "duration_sec": 6.921
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C15-D006",
   "turn_index": 5,
   "speaker": "中村",
   "source_text": "今日はあそこに普通の電話がありますね。では、買い物の後の雑談をお願いします。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C15-D006-S01",
    "C15-D006-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-tutor-1",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 28.505,
   "end_sec": 34.628,
   "duration_sec": 6.123
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C15-D007",
   "turn_index": 6,
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "source_text": "やあ、パンがいっぱいあるね。全部食べた？",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C15-D007-S01",
    "C15-D007-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-commercial-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 34.978,
   "end_sec": 38.437,
   "duration_sec": 3.459
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C15-D008",
   "turn_index": 7,
   "speaker": "林梅",
   "source_text": "いや、まだ食べていない。今日の昼ご飯だよ。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C15-D008-S01",
    "C15-D008-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 38.787,
   "end_sec": 42.215,
   "duration_sec": 3.428
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C15-D009",
   "turn_index": 8,
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "source_text": "うーん、パンはあまり好きではない。でも、このパンはうまいね。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C15-D009-S01",
    "C15-D009-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-commercial-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 42.565,
   "end_sec": 46.731,
   "duration_sec": 4.166
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C15-D010",
   "turn_index": 9,
   "speaker": "林梅",
   "source_text": "もう食べているね。パンは嫌だった？",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C15-D010-S01",
    "C15-D010-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 47.081,
   "end_sec": 49.878,
   "duration_sec": 2.797
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C15-D011",
   "turn_index": 10,
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "source_text": "冗談だよ。ただ、少し食べたい。お金はもう全然ない。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C15-D011-S01",
    "C15-D011-S02",
    "C15-D011-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-commercial-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 50.228,
   "end_sec": 54.778,
   "duration_sec": 4.55
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C15-D012",
   "turn_index": 11,
   "speaker": "林梅",
   "source_text": "まあ、全部で六百円だったよ。高くなかった。昨日はバーゲンだった。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C15-D012-S01",
    "C15-D012-S02",
    "C15-D012-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 55.128,
   "end_sec": 59.992,
   "duration_sec": 4.864
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C15-D013",
   "turn_index": 12,
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "source_text": "へええ、安かったね。おつりは紙幣だった？",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C15-D013-S01",
    "C15-D013-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-commercial-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 60.342,
   "end_sec": 63.907,
   "duration_sec": 3.565
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C15-D014",
   "turn_index": 13,
   "speaker": "林梅",
   "source_text": "いや、硬貨だった。四百円だよ。買い物の後はあまりしゃべらなかったね。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C15-D014-S01",
    "C15-D014-S02",
    "C15-D014-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 64.257,
   "end_sec": 70.74,
   "duration_sec": 6.483
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C15-D015",
   "turn_index": 14,
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "source_text": "うん、黙っていた。次の買い物を考えていた。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C15-D015-S01",
    "C15-D015-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-commercial-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 71.09,
   "end_sec": 74.959,
   "duration_sec": 3.869
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C15-D016",
   "turn_index": 15,
   "speaker": "林梅",
   "source_text": "じゃ、明日もなんか買う？",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C15-D016-S01"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 75.309,
   "end_sec": 77.433,
   "duration_sec": 2.124
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C15-D017",
   "turn_index": 16,
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "source_text": "やっぱり明日はパンを買う。家でゆっくり食べたい。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C15-D017-S01",
    "C15-D017-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-commercial-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 77.783,
   "end_sec": 81.077,
   "duration_sec": 3.294
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C15-D018",
   "turn_index": 17,
   "speaker": "中村",
   "source_text": "いいですね。今の会話は練習です。今日、本当は何を食べましたか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C15-D018-S01",
    "C15-D018-S02",
    "C15-D018-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-tutor-1",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 81.427,
   "end_sec": 87.042,
   "duration_sec": 5.615
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C15-D019",
   "turn_index": 18,
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "source_text": "家でご飯と魚を食べました。朝はパンを食べませんでした。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C15-D019-S01",
    "C15-D019-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-commercial-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 87.392,
   "end_sec": 91.182,
   "duration_sec": 3.79
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C15-D020",
   "turn_index": 19,
   "speaker": "林梅",
   "source_text": "私はパンと卵です。先生、次は挨拶の練習ですか。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C15-D020-S01",
    "C15-D020-S02"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 91.532,
   "end_sec": 96.841,
   "duration_sec": 5.309
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C15-D021",
   "turn_index": 20,
   "speaker": "中村",
   "source_text": "はい。来週は田中先生も来ます。丁寧なメールを書いてください。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C15-D021-S01",
    "C15-D021-S02",
    "C15-D021-S03"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-tutor-1",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 97.191,
   "end_sec": 102.186,
   "duration_sec": 4.995
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C15-D022",
   "turn_index": 21,
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "source_text": "こんにちは。私はマテオです。来週の土曜日、一時に行きます。どうぞよろしくお願いします。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C15-D022-S01",
    "C15-D022-S02",
    "C15-D022-S03",
    "C15-D022-S04"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-commercial-4",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": true,
   "review_flags": [
    "clip_asr_difference",
    "manual_nonsilent_boundary"
   ],
   "start_sec": 102.536,
   "end_sec": 108.39,
   "duration_sec": 5.854
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C15-D023",
   "turn_index": 22,
   "speaker": "林梅",
   "source_text": "先生の返事は「こちらこそ、よろしくお願いします」ですね。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C15-D023-S01"
   ],
   "voice_id": "ja-jp-concierge-7",
   "status": "candidate",
   "review_needed": false,
   "review_flags": [],
   "start_sec": 108.74,
   "end_sec": 112.861,
   "duration_sec": 4.121
  },
  {
   "turn_id": "C15-D024",
   "turn_index": 23,
   "speaker": "中村",
   "source_text": "そうですね。もう二時です。今日もどうもありがとうございました。来週も一緒に練習しましょう。",
   "sentence_ids": [
    "C15-D024-S01",
