  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C15-D011-S01",
   "unit_id": "C15-D011",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "text": "冗談だよ。",
   "start_sec": 50.228,
   "end_sec": 51.6,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C15-D011-S02",
   "unit_id": "C15-D011",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "text": "ただ、少し食べたい。",
   "start_sec": 51.75,
   "end_sec": 53.159,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C15-D011-S03",
   "unit_id": "C15-D011",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "text": "お金はもう全然ない。",
   "start_sec": 53.309,
   "end_sec": 54.778,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C15-D012-S01",
   "unit_id": "C15-D012",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "リン",
   "text": "まあ、全部で六百円だったよ。",
   "start_sec": 55.128,
   "end_sec": 57.168,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C15-D012-S02",
   "unit_id": "C15-D012",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "リン",
   "text": "高くなかった。",
   "start_sec": 57.318,
   "end_sec": 58.415,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C15-D012-S03",
   "unit_id": "C15-D012",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "リン",
   "text": "昨日はバーゲンだった。",
   "start_sec": 58.565,
   "end_sec": 59.992,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C15-D013-S01",
   "unit_id": "C15-D013",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "text": "へええ、安かったね。",
   "start_sec": 60.342,
   "end_sec": 62.194,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C15-D013-S02",
   "unit_id": "C15-D013",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "text": "おつりは紙幣だった？",
   "start_sec": 62.344,
   "end_sec": 63.907,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C15-D014-S01",
   "unit_id": "C15-D014",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "リン",
   "text": "いや、硬貨だった。",
   "start_sec": 64.257,
   "end_sec": 65.844,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C15-D014-S02",
   "unit_id": "C15-D014",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "リン",
   "text": "四百円だよ。",
   "start_sec": 65.994,
   "end_sec": 67.648,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C15-D014-S03",
   "unit_id": "C15-D014",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "リン",
   "text": "買い物の後はあまりしゃべらなかったね。",
   "start_sec": 67.798,
   "end_sec": 70.74,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C15-D015-S01",
   "unit_id": "C15-D015",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "text": "うん、黙っていた。",
   "start_sec": 71.09,
   "end_sec": 72.722,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C15-D015-S02",
   "unit_id": "C15-D015",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "text": "次の買い物を考えていた。",
   "start_sec": 72.872,
   "end_sec": 74.959,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C15-D016-S01",
   "unit_id": "C15-D016",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "リン",
   "text": "じゃ、明日もなんか買う？",
   "start_sec": 75.309,
   "end_sec": 77.433,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C15-D017-S01",
   "unit_id": "C15-D017",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "text": "やっぱり明日はパンを買う。",
   "start_sec": 77.783,
   "end_sec": 79.399,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C15-D017-S02",
   "unit_id": "C15-D017",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "text": "家でゆっくり食べたい。",
   "start_sec": 79.549,
   "end_sec": 81.077,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C15-D018-S01",
   "unit_id": "C15-D018",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "中村",
   "text": "いいですね。",
   "start_sec": 81.427,
   "end_sec": 82.645,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C15-D018-S02",
   "unit_id": "C15-D018",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "中村",
   "text": "今の会話は練習です。",
   "start_sec": 82.795,
   "end_sec": 84.598,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C15-D018-S03",
   "unit_id": "C15-D018",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "中村",
   "text": "今日、本当は何を食べましたか。",
   "start_sec": 84.748,
   "end_sec": 87.042,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C15-D019-S01",
   "unit_id": "C15-D019",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "text": "家でご飯と魚を食べました。",
   "start_sec": 87.392,
   "end_sec": 89.363,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C15-D019-S02",
   "unit_id": "C15-D019",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "text": "朝はパンを食べませんでした。",
   "start_sec": 89.513,
   "end_sec": 91.182,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C15-D020-S01",
   "unit_id": "C15-D020",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "リン",
   "text": "私はパンと卵です。",
   "start_sec": 91.532,
   "end_sec": 93.666,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C15-D020-S02",
   "unit_id": "C15-D020",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "リン",
   "text": "先生、次は挨拶の練習ですか。",
   "start_sec": 93.816,
   "end_sec": 96.841,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C15-D021-S01",
   "unit_id": "C15-D021",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "中村",
   "text": "はい。",
   "start_sec": 97.191,
   "end_sec": 98.112,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C15-D021-S02",
   "unit_id": "C15-D021",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "中村",
   "text": "来週は田中先生も来ます。",
   "start_sec": 98.262,
   "end_sec": 100.261,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C15-D021-S03",
   "unit_id": "C15-D021",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "中村",
   "text": "丁寧なメールを書いてください。",
   "start_sec": 100.411,
   "end_sec": 102.186,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C15-D022-S01",
   "unit_id": "C15-D022",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "text": "こんにちは。",
   "start_sec": 102.536,
   "end_sec": 103.156,
   "review_flags": [
    "clip_asr_difference",
    "manual_nonsilent_boundary"
   ],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C15-D022-S02",
   "unit_id": "C15-D022",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "text": "私はマテオです。",
   "start_sec": 103.306,
   "end_sec": 104.36,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C15-D022-S03",
   "unit_id": "C15-D022",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "text": "来週の土曜日、一時に行きます。",
   "start_sec": 104.51,
   "end_sec": 106.582,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C15-D022-S04",
   "unit_id": "C15-D022",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "マテオ",
   "text": "どうぞよろしくお願いします。",
   "start_sec": 106.732,
   "end_sec": 108.39,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C15-D023-S01",
   "unit_id": "C15-D023",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "リン",
   "text": "先生の返事は「こちらこそ、よろしくお願いします」ですね。",
   "start_sec": 108.74,
   "end_sec": 112.861,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C15-D024-S01",
   "unit_id": "C15-D024",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "中村",
   "text": "そうですね。",
   "start_sec": 113.211,
   "end_sec": 114.308,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C15-D024-S02",
   "unit_id": "C15-D024",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "中村",
   "text": "もう二時です。",
   "start_sec": 114.458,
   "end_sec": 115.531,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C15-D024-S03",
   "unit_id": "C15-D024",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "中村",
   "text": "今日もどうもありがとうございました。",
   "start_sec": 115.681,
   "end_sec": 117.788,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  },
  {
   "sentence_id": "C15-D024-S04",
   "unit_id": "C15-D024",
   "section": "D",
   "speaker": "中村",
   "text": "来週も一緒に練習しましょう。",
   "start_sec": 117.938,
   "end_sec": 119.756,
   "review_flags": [],
   "replacement": null
  }
 ]
}
